+    <section anchor="reading-list" numbered="false" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-unnumbered-5">
+      <name slugifiedName="name-reading-list">Reading List:</name>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-unnumbered-5-1">We are aware of little that has been written on the subject of automated
+resource sharing.  However, the following items are relevant (at least
+marginally) to the workshop.  Please inform us of others of which you
+are aware.</t>
+      <ol spacing="compact" type="1" indent="adaptive" start="1" pn="section-unnumbered-5-2">
+        <li pn="section-unnumbered-5-2.1" derivedCounter="1.">ARPANET NEWS, Issue 2, Report on COMPCON 73 "Birds of a Feather
+Session" on Resource Sharing Networks, NIC 15337.</li>
+        <li pn="section-unnumbered-5-2.2" derivedCounter="2.">"A Resource Sharing Executive for the ARPANET", R. Thomas, Preprint
+of paper for 1973 National Computer Conference, BBN Report 2522, NIC
+#14689.</li>
+        <li pn="section-unnumbered-5-2.3" derivedCounter="3.">"Terminal Access to the ARPANET - Experience and Improvements", N.
+Mimno, B. Cosell, Walden, et. al., COMPCON 73 Proceedings, NIC
+14791.</li>
+        <li pn="section-unnumbered-5-2.4" derivedCounter="4.">"A Tentative Proposal for a Modified User Protocol", M. Padlipsky,
+RFC 451, NIC #14135.</li>
+        <li pn="section-unnumbered-5-2.5" derivedCounter="5.">"Interentity Communication - An experiment", R. Bressler, R. Thomas,
+RFC 441, NIC 13773.</li>
+        <li pn="section-unnumbered-5-2.6" derivedCounter="6.">"Netbank", J. Postel, RFC 408, NIC #12390.</li>
+      </ol>
